        <item>
            <title>1.5.5</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:03:30 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/Titi257/lina/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>16</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Lina 1.5.5</h2>
<ul>
<li>Call links (Settings, General): the setting now shows which app opens phone-number links today, and explains how to choose Lina when macOS does not let Lina do it by itself. Until now the “Use Lina” button could do nothing without saying why.</li>
<li>Contacts: the name the Contacts app sorts by is shown in bold, as in Apple's list.</li>
<li>Language: “System language (English)” replaces “Mac's language”, with the detected language.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
