        <item>
            <title>1.5.4</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:56:51 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/Titi257/lina/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>15</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Lina 1.5.4</h2>
<ul>
<li>Call screen: while a call is being recorded, the record button is white with a red square, so it can no longer be mistaken for the red hang-up button.</li>
<li>Compact window: the Statistics screen is laid out for a narrow window (tiles two by two, nothing cut), and the Accounts screen no longer breaks the address or the status in two.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
